id: power-of-friendship
name: Power of Friendship
# A Fusion Modifier: chosen as a Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand. Its Prerequisite is shown there, never enforced.
fusionModifier: true
description: >
  Due to your Fused Characters’ perfect synchronicity, your power has skyrocketed.
text: >
  Power of Friendship: Due to your Fused Characters’ perfect synchronicity, your power has skyrocketed.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: This Fusion was created with 2 Fused Characters and those Fused Characters have declared the other Fused Character as their ‘Partner’ through the first effect of the Synchronized Combatant Talent.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Tier of Power by 1 (see — Breakthrough).
  (3)-[Passive]: This Fusion is its own Partner.

---

[passive]
# (2) "see - Breakthrough": never more than two above its base Tier.
tierOfPower += 1;
# (3) Its own Partner, wherever a Partner is asked for (effects/conditions.mjs partnerOf).
allow fusion.ownPartner;
